	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Accès Postgres depuis autre PC]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=28606#p28606"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>J&#039;ai essayé ceci : <br />local&#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;md5<br />host&#160; &#160; all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;192.168.1.38/32&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;md5<br />host&#160; &#160; all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;::1/128&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;md5<br />host&#160; &#160; replication&#160; &#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;127.0.0.1/32&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; md5<br />host&#160; &#160; replication&#160; &#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;::1/128&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;md5</p><p>mais j&#039;obtiens le message &quot;FATAL : n&#039;a pas pu charger pg_hba.conf&quot; depuis le poste local ou depuis mon autre pc.</p>]]></content>
		<author>
			<name><![CDATA[noonshak]]></name>
